{"id": "0190", "language": "zh", "kind": "reference", "text": "請翻到約翰三書第一章第三節", "target": [64, 1, 3], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 175, "split": "calibration", "duration_s": 3.2595, "sha256": "5d248e54b3e513b0d609472610371fc7bf2d36f85132db3013a589fd24da8e70", "transcript": "请翻到约翰三书第一章第三节。", "decode_s": 0.9110318749444559, "cpu_s": 0.03932700000000011, "rtf": 0.2795004985256806, "max_rss_bytes": 619397120, "edits": 0, "units": 13, "reference": [64, 1, 3], "reference_correct": true}
{"id": "0195", "language": "zh", "kind": "reference", "text": "啟示錄第一章第一節", "target": [66, 1, 1], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 150, "split": "calibration", "duration_s": 2.234625, "sha256": "b2c10dc74046061d214e4743ef84376c02808baab9ec0cc2f9f44ee7c9e7e406", "transcript": "提示路基渣地一节", "decode_s": 0.9254674999974668, "cpu_s": 0.035960000000000214, "rtf": 0.41414890641493174, "max_rss_bytes": 619397120, "edits": 6, "units": 9, "reference": null, "reference_correct": false}
{"id": "0200", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "我已將你的名指示他們，還要指示他們，使你所愛我的愛在他們裏面，我也在他們裏面。」", "target": [43, 17, 26], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 195, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 7.6585, "sha256": "424a1e079b7762618fc5b88f6f03569ed749f15dd5cd84631b377b807cee2c8e", "transcript": "我已将你的名指示他们,还要指示他们,使你所爱我的爱在他们里面,我也在他们里面。", "decode_s": 1.150658666039817, "cpu_s": 0.07298500000000008, "rtf": 0.1502459575686906, "max_rss_bytes": 619397120, "edits": 0, "units": 35, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0205", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "耶穌說：「狐狸有洞，天空的飛鳥有窩，只是人子沒有枕頭的地方。」", "target": [42, 9, 58], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 175, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 5.9879375, "sha256": "ac50e6bee5207129e498a63d97b4b2955b209be9f3546b948a4f18c399308f43", "transcript": "耶稣说,湖里有洞,天空的飞鸟有窝,只是人最没有枕头的地方。", "decode_s": 1.0939184169983491, "cpu_s": 0.09937500000000021, "rtf": 0.18268701318247713, "max_rss_bytes": 619397120, "edits": 3, "units": 25, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0210", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "並使他的兒子經火，又觀兆，用法術，立交鬼的和行巫術的，多行耶和華眼中看爲惡的事，惹動他的怒氣；", "target": [12, 21, 6], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 150, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 11.6820625, "sha256": "185eba70c75be61592970fd9a7951f4cdde6d961c3758e1e771ac78f2767cd64", "transcript": "并使他的儿子惊火,又观照,用法术,力教鬼的汉形巫术的,多形耶和华眼中看为恶的事,惹惹惹的事,惹惹惹,惹惹,惹惹,惹惹,惹惹,惹惹,惹惹,惹惹,惹惹,惹惹,惹惹,惹惹,惹惹,惹惹,惹惹,惹惹,惹惹,惹惹,惹惹,惹惹,惹惹,惹惹,惹惹,惹惹,惹惹,惹惹,惹惹,惹惹,惹惹,惹惹,惹惹,惹惹,惹", "decode_s": 1.735162458033301, "cpu_s": 0.3641059999999996, "rtf": 0.14853220123015956, "max_rss_bytes": 619397120, "edits": 76, "units": 41, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0215", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "我們出錢才得水喝； 我們的柴是人賣給我們的。", "target": [25, 5, 4], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 195, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 3.7561875, "sha256": "d6d581a24a30285d7e618d4214660a87ea387e67cac5e7a16cf67d60df025fe3", "transcript": "我们出钱采的水和我们的柴是人卖给我们的。", "decode_s": 1.0147967078955844, "cpu_s": 0.07617699999999994, "rtf": 0.2701666804161359, "max_rss_bytes": 619397120, "edits": 3, "units": 19, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0220", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "不可露你兒婦的下體；她是你兒子的妻，不可露她的下體。", "target": [3, 18, 15], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 175, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 5.3570625, "sha256": "6c5c3d6b34682f9a1957506a739062d4b1ddca8feb8654a1d6d3c1dc8dde7ae8", "transcript": "不可录你儿父的下体,他是你儿子的妻,不可录他的下体。", "decode_s": 1.4567797919735312, "cpu_s": 0.08341500000000002, "rtf": 0.27193630687966236, "max_rss_bytes": 619397120, "edits": 5, "units": 23, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0225", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "說：「以掃若來擊殺這一隊，剩下的那一隊還可以逃避。」", "target": [1, 32, 8], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 150, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 5.8491875, "sha256": "dd8b36777f59b916bea82159fcf9101aaee55236caefc5cb874cdf2f8006dbf1", "transcript": "说,以扫若来击杀这一对,剩下的那一对还可以逃避。", "decode_s": 0.9028047919273376, "cpu_s": 0.08556000000000008, "rtf": 0.15434704254690718, "max_rss_bytes": 619397120, "edits": 2, "units": 21, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0230", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "麥西生路低人、亞拿米人、利哈比人、拿弗土希人、", "target": [1, 10, 13], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 195, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 5.187875, "sha256": "fac345f1232a649e07e1ed0e1b81aadda177d7c74c0c9c782d567fc53608eb7b", "transcript": "麦西生路滴人,亚拿米人,利哈比人,拿福土西人。", "decode_s": 0.9398051250027493, "cpu_s": 0.06426899999999991, "rtf": 0.18115415753131084, "max_rss_bytes": 619397120, "edits": 3, "units": 19, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0235", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "一月之內，我除滅三個牧人，因爲我的心厭煩他們；他們的心也憎嫌我。", "target": [38, 11, 8], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 175, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 6.277, "sha256": "58b1431c312ed2ba3ed562dc447e2781db217ec01002ce70e9f19bbe208318d7", "transcript": "一月之内,我除灭三个牧人,因我的心养伞他们,他们的心也尊贤我。", "decode_s": 1.0114690409973264, "cpu_s": 0.07801599999999986, "rtf": 0.16113892639753485, "max_rss_bytes": 619397120, "edits": 5, "units": 28, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0240", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "七月二十三日，王遣散衆民；他們因見耶和華向大衛和所羅門與他民以色列所施的恩惠，就都心中喜樂，各歸各家去了。", "target": [14, 7, 10], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 150, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 13.3354375, "sha256": "e26bec90520c9bd6aa84b66b1223db41036e4b29b0be4e557317794c6835606d", "transcript": "7月23日,王潜散众明,他们应见耶和华向大魏和所罗门与他明以色列所施的恩惠,救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救救", "decode_s": 1.570804666960612, "cpu_s": 0.23198000000000008, "rtf": 0.11779176100976155, "max_rss_bytes": 619397120, "edits": 179, "units": 47, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0245", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "惟恐多說，你嫌煩絮，只求你寬容聽我們說幾句話。", "target": [44, 24, 4], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 195, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 4.8430625, "sha256": "00ef4e9f454443ba713334f6b9e4d9a103b4fd4941c7766ec1fd80094eaf1b45", "transcript": "唯恐多说,你嫌烦事,只求你宽容听我们说几句话。", "decode_s": 0.9964280420681462, "cpu_s": 0.06772199999999984, "rtf": 0.20574337871298298, "max_rss_bytes": 619397120, "edits": 2, "units": 20, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0250", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "所羅門在耶路撒冷作以色列衆人的王共四十年。", "target": [11, 11, 42], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 175, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 4.77875, "sha256": "d74109bdae85bf1ffaa5fc992e79800ef803e43b773470941f7a8a9e75e0905e", "transcript": "所罗门在耶路撒冷做以色列众人的王共四十年。", "decode_s": 1.417864124989137, "cpu_s": 0.0944850000000006, "rtf": 0.29670188333541975, "max_rss_bytes": 619397120, "edits": 1, "units": 20, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0255", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "主－我們的 神是憐憫饒恕人的，我們卻違背了他，", "target": [27, 9, 9], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 150, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 4.662875, "sha256": "b0fc20dbfb23b132ccaa91ac7984e79b15f3729b3ad2f0f570fbbf9fc15bdf3f", "transcript": "我们却违背了他。", "decode_s": 0.9671430001035333, "cpu_s": 0.04784800000000011, "rtf": 0.2074134520233833, "max_rss_bytes": 619397120, "edits": 12, "units": 19, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0260", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "從那日起，我的僕人一半做工，一半拿槍、拿盾牌、拿弓、穿 鎧甲，官長都站在猶大衆人的後邊。", "target": [16, 4, 16], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 195, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 9.3191875, "sha256": "83b250bbda44fc0b81eb0c1eca1227460bc1c705a3dc4e45a2a1e45c7d17aad6", "transcript": "从那日起,我的仆人一半做工,一半拿枪,拿盾牌,拿弓,穿铠甲,官长都站在犹大众人的后边。", "decode_s": 0.9821230829693377, "cpu_s": 0.14646999999999988, "rtf": 0.10538720065127327, "max_rss_bytes": 619397120, "edits": 0, "units": 36, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0265", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "埃及中，無論是頭與尾， 棕枝與蘆葦，所做之工都不成就。", "target": [23, 19, 15], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 175, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 5.4676875, "sha256": "35b50527bede503d5e471d0703dcb15a95ed4d8974022841aec304b637ef7d86", "transcript": "在埃及中,无论是头与尾,宗之与卢尾,所作之功都不成就。", "decode_s": 0.7981278339866549, "cpu_s": 0.11006800000000005, "rtf": 0.14597173558047252, "max_rss_bytes": 619397120, "edits": 7, "units": 22, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0270", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "願憐恤、平安、慈愛多多地加給你們。", "target": [65, 1, 2], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 150, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 4.3475, "sha256": "a33bf219e5380b0db08f50eb101f6f6f7bf81195133ec96b7aaddfe9c41d6f76", "transcript": "愿连续、平安、慈爱多多地加紧你们。", "decode_s": 1.0028387089259923, "cpu_s": 0.07148100000000035, "rtf": 0.23067020331822707, "max_rss_bytes": 619397120, "edits": 3, "units": 14, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0275", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "你們不要自欺；濫交是敗壞善行。", "target": [46, 15, 33], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 195, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 2.889, "sha256": "8cb0ae1b49a7f7f3f048c169debb18155cfd4a5e9026bdd92fbc7aca36dd3795", "transcript": "女人不要罪欺,乱交失败换上行。", "decode_s": 0.9315461249789223, "cpu_s": 0.05193799999999982, "rtf": 0.32244587226684746, "max_rss_bytes": 619397120, "edits": 7, "units": 13, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0280", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "並且因爲他是人子，就賜給他行審判的權柄。", "target": [43, 5, 26], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 175, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 4.649375, "sha256": "eef60d763cc19b9b22428a36c5403745a26382eb0756534482552fadf7d682fe", "transcript": "并且因为他是人子,就赐给他行审判的权柄。", "decode_s": 1.131294541992247, "cpu_s": 0.05862000000000034, "rtf": 0.24332185336572057, "max_rss_bytes": 619397120, "edits": 0, "units": 18, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0285", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "那獻供物的就要將細面伊法十分之一，並油一欣四分之一，調和作素祭，獻給耶和華。", "target": [4, 15, 4], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 150, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 8.774375, "sha256": "547dbd6a18ccf53b7598322e95b8b32b45fa6b0ffe669274de85ffe7dc0f24dc", "transcript": "那献贡物罪就要将信念依法十分之一,并留意新四分之一,调合作素计,献给耶和华。", "decode_s": 1.081463749986142, "cpu_s": 0.13989299999999982, "rtf": 0.12325251086101768, "max_rss_bytes": 619397120, "edits": 10, "units": 35, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0290", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "說假預言的先知，就是預言本心詭詐的先知，他們這樣存心要到幾時呢？ 他們各人將所做的夢對鄰舍述說，想要使我的百姓忘記我的名，正如他們列祖因巴力忘記我的名一樣。", "target": [24, 23, 26], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 195, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": true, "duration_s": 15.1954375, "sha256": "0f34e7a970e48f75cdbfe2b722548b91e0cd9e80afd278c12da95b23feb762b2", "transcript": "说假预言的先知,就是预言本心诡诈的先知,他们这样存心要到几时呢?他们个人将所做的梦对灵摄树说,想要使我我使我我使我我使我我使我我使我我使我我使我我使我我使我我使我我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使我使", "decode_s": 1.6816928340122104, "cpu_s": 0.4688509999999999, "rtf": 0.11067090592240009, "max_rss_bytes": 619397120, "edits": 166, "units": 73, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0295", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "我們要爲你編上金辮，鑲上銀釘。 〔新娘〕 王正坐席的時候， 我的哪噠香膏發出香味。", "target": [22, 1, 11], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 175, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": true, "duration_s": 7.5255625, "sha256": "b66706466c716444a2b8456c6eea8cb9e669531ac1e484ae6c86ce588a64ffd2", "transcript": "我们要你边上筋片,虾上一度。新娘花众做席的时候,我跟拿大虾高发出香味。", "decode_s": 0.6086666249902919, "cpu_s": 0.07774400000000004, "rtf": 0.08087988439273368, "max_rss_bytes": 619397120, "edits": 15, "units": 32, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
